{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c63f","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0d33e-21a1-7dd1-8410-6ee446430389"},"sequence":378,"recorded_at":1780531400000751,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"4e561a79-c0d9-4ce2-8e43-bf7439b5274c","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"4e561a79-c0d9-4ce2-8e43-bf7439b5274c","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"4e561a79-c0d9-4ce2-8e43-bf7439b5274c"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0d33e-e0aa-7d02-9fd6-ff239a5eb325"},"task_id":"01a0d33e-e0aa-7d02-9fd6-ff239a5eb325","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0d33e-e0aa-7d02-9fd6-ff239a5eb325","chunk":"Read text file `internal/cloneplanning/effects.go`.\n1|package cloneplanning\n2|\n3|import (\n4|\t\"github.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/clonefidelity\"\n5|)\n6|\n7|// This file folds planned mappings to target effects: callable\n8|// tools, pending actions, and target token accounting. Historical\n9|// tools are inert and source usage is not target accounting\n10|// (Section 13.14.1), so the fold is always empty: no mapping admits\n11|// a live effect. Mappings carry no token field by type, so token\n12|// counts cannot reach the accounting decision at all; the sweep\n13|// proves every mapping the planner emits folds to zero.\n14|\n15|// TargetEffects is the planned session's live surface: callable\n16|// tools, pending actions, and target token accounting. Planning\n17|// from captured history always yields the zero value.\n18|type TargetEffects struct {\n19|\tCallableTools      []string\n20|\tPendingActions     []string\n21|\tTargetInputTokens  uint64\n22|\tTargetOutputTokens uint64\n23|}\n24|\n25|// PlanTargetEffects folds planned mappings to their target\n26|// effects: always empty. Every mapping is validated first (closed\n27|// disposition, vocabulary reasons in sorted-unique order), so\n28|// garbage mappings refuse instead of folding.\n29|func PlanTargetEffects(mappings []Mapping) (TargetEffects, error) {\n30|\tfor index, mapping := range mappings {\n31|\t\tif !clonefidelity.ValidDisposition(mapping.Disposition) {\n32|\t\t\treturn TargetEffects{}, invalid(\"target effects mapping[%d] disposition %q is outside the Section 13.14.2 vocabulary\", index, mapping.Disposition)\n33|\t\t}\n34|\t\tfor _, reason := range mapping.Reasons {\n35|\t\t\tif !clonefidelity.ValidReasonCode(reason) {\n36|\t\t\t\treturn TargetEffects{}, invalid(\"target effects mapping[%d] reason %q is not a core or reverse-DNS reason\", index, reason)\n37|\t\t\t}\n38|\t\t}\n39|\t\tfor position := 1; position < len(mapping.Reasons); position++ {\n40|\t\t\tif mapping.Reasons[position-1] >= mapping.Reasons[position] {\n41|\t\t\t\treturn TargetEffects{}, invalid(\"target effects mapping[%d] reasons are not sorted unique\", index)\n42|\t\t\t}\n43|\t\t}\n44|\t}\n45|\treturn TargetEffects{}, nil\n46|}","final_result":true}}}
