matches, three runs.\n\n**Validation (real exits, all 0).** Package suite, 98.1% cover, `-count=3` determinism, package race, 9 owner suites, full suite 48/48 in 4 shards, 17 fuzz commands, vet/Windows vet, gofmt/builds incl. linux+windows, tracecheck, cataloggen, JSON sweep, board validate, diff checks, scratch-index hygiene, importer grid 232/232 identical with nothing moved. Coverage measured 18 of 18 AC rows. Not run myself: full-cover and full-race (bounded-call budget, unchanged identity for 47/48 packages; CR validation reruns them) — stated in the results. Trunk still `6d3bff9`, so no refresh was needed. Candidate is 20 paths, uncommitted; results, matrix, and 47KB evidence tar are attached as rev4 resources.","reason":null}}
